        "created_at": "2014-03-15T02:39:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I actually find the Chairman /easier/ on advanced. Sure he does more damage and takes far less, but he flips far sooner, allowing heroes to wail on him much faster without having to go through as many turns with the thugs/underbosses</p>",
