        "created_at": "2014-03-15T15:39:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>They are called Hired Guns, not Hitmen ;).</p><p>Our main problem against the Chairman is just that we have so much trouble getting rid of all the targets - we just get outnumbered and overwhelmed by everything. And even if we manage to kill some underbosses, well, there comes a Prison Break soon afterwards. Dammit :P.</p>",
