        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/73ab20/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-03-15T15:59:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It'd be interesting to try The Sentinels vs. The Chairman (I wonder if Rook City is in the Southwest?).&nbsp; On the downside, a Contract and two Hitmen would just about kill your entire team, but if you can get off a well-timed Blackout, you could wipe out the entire enemy army.&nbsp; And the thought of Flinging Chairman Pike into Darkness is just spectacular.</p>",
