      {
        "id": 95475,
        "name": "JimmytheRat",
        "username": "JimmytheRat",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/c37758/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-03-16T07:51:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Blackout is best used on a Thug of some sort, so they'll be doing 3-7 damage to everyone instead of just 2, and then the Chairman's retaliation can kill them once you're finished.&nbsp; You'll likely have to eat a bunch of revenge damage from the Operative, but it'd be SO WORTH IT.</p>",
