      {
        "id": 95478,
        "name": "Edwin",
        "username": "Edwin",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/73ab20/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-03-20T02:19:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Worse, if you kill the Chairman first, he might just get shuffled into the deck and played again, back on side A (as far as we know that's how you're supposed to handle it).&nbsp; Personally, I pretty much always kill the Operative first.&nbsp; Or rather, try to; it's less common that it actually happens.</p>",
